# Raw game records. Local run artefacts, not the research record: a 40-game
# pilot is ~7MB and a full grid would be hundreds. The committed record is
# reports/<run_id>/ — the markdown report plus turns.csv, which carries every
# analysable field. Raw games are reproducible from configs + position set,
# and belong in a data release rather than in git history.
results/
